  "current_local_event_rules": "1. The Alliance that occupies Arcadia for 1 consecutive hour in the battle that lasts 2 hours, or holds the longest occupation time at the end of the event, will claim victory in Arcadian Conquest.\n\n2. After securing victory in the Arcadian Conquest, the winning Alliance's Leader will automatically be appointed as the Governor. (If the Leader role is transferred, the Governor title is transferred as well.)\n\n3. Occupying the Arcadia Towers can help in the attack on Arcadia. The longer that the Towers are occupied, the higher the frequency of attacks.\n\n4. The Arcadian Conquest takes place weekly.\n\n5. One hour before the start of the event, the Settlements in the alert zone near Arcadia will be forcibly and randomly relocated. Starting 50 minutes before the event commences until the end of the event, you can relocate freely into the alert zone. However, the Peace Flares of the Settlements in the alert zone will be removed and cannot be activated again. If a Settlement within the alert zone is defeated by an enemy, it will immediately be relocated to a random location.\n\n6. In Arcadian Conquest battles, a very small number of wounded soldiers may die.",
